WEBVTT

00:00:00.633 --> 00:00:03.313
Line Select's order is a starting point —

00:00:03.313 --> 00:00:10.763
you have the final say. If a line is in the wrong place, drag it by its handle onto another line and the two swap.

00:00:10.763 --> 00:00:12.658
They stay where you put them.

00:00:13.358 --> 00:00:18.204
Every swap also teaches it something, and it tells you what it took from it.

00:00:18.204 --> 00:00:24.326
If it can't tell why you swapped, it asks you, once: tap the reason, or say they're about equal.

00:00:25.026 --> 00:00:29.486
Tiers let you group your lines: Best, Better, Good, Backup and Not bid.

00:00:29.486 --> 00:00:32.627
Open a line and tap a tier, or press a number key.

00:00:32.627 --> 00:00:40.794
To move a whole run at once, shift-click to select them, or right-click for "select all above" or "below", and move them together.

00:00:40.794 --> 00:00:43.558
Anything in "Not bid" stays out of your bid.

00:00:44.258 --> 00:00:50.081
"Set aside" takes a line out of the way while you sort, without dropping it from your bid.

00:00:50.081 --> 00:00:52.345
Change your mind on anything? Undo.

